contentText:
David Ahumada has been appointed head of CAN LATAM at ONE Publishing.

With more than 10 years of experience in the publishing industry, Ahumada, a Colombian music executive, will consolidate operations in the Andean region and accelerate regional growth aligned with ONE Publishing’s global vision. His new role will focus on active catalog development, regional partnerships creations and the optimization of services.&nbsp;

